	text: [
		"§bQuantum Helmet§r restores the air meter using EU and automatically feeds the player with §6(Filled) Tin Cans§r, restoring both hunger and nutrition.\n\n§bQuantum Chestplate§r greatly reduces incoming damage and grants full immunity to fire and lava.\n\n§bQuantum Leggings§r boost sprinting speed drastically, but drain EU and food quickly.\n\n§bQuantum Boots§r prevent fall damage and allow high jumps (~10 blocks) when holding the boost key (default: Ctrl) and pressing jump.\n\nAfter completing this quest, mobs will spawn with this armor set sometimes."
